#: ../../tools/cancer_prognosis_tools.rst:32 797c907b2c7d489aa6fce8d0bce93789
msgid ""
"**Description**: Fetch gene expression values (RNA-seq) for a specific "
"gene across cancer samples in a TCGA or cBioPortal study. Returns per-"
"sample expression values with summary statistics (mean, median, min, "
"max). Output can be combined with survival data for expression-based "
"prognostic analysis. Supports 33 TCGA cancer types and any cBioPortal "
"study with mRNA expression data."
msgstr ""

