"disease-free survival (DFS) data from a TCGA or cBioPortal cancer study. "
"Returns per-patient survival times, event status, and age. Data can be "
"directly used with Survival\\_kaplan\\_meier or "
"Survival\\_log\\_rank\\_test tools for custom survival analyses. Supports"
" 33 TCGA cancer types (BRCA, LUAD, COAD, GBM, etc.) and 400+ cBioPortal "
"studies."
